          "timestamp": 1782349820,
          "caption": "We often look down on things because they’re “cliché.”\n\nBut we forget that they became cliché for a reason. Those ideas were so relatable and timeless that they became overused. \n\nSo maybe the answer you’re searching for isn’t some complicated, profound revelation.\n\nMaybe it’s right in front of you, hidden as something you’ve dismissed as cliché.\n\nI took these at @monography, a self-portrait studio. It was so fun and I love how everything turned out! \n\n#monography #photoshootposes #selfportraitphotography #selfgrowthquotes #hopecore",
