        {
          "id": "3921112330024510938",
          "shortcode": "DZqluOjg-Xa",
          "timestamp": 1781653385,
          "caption": "I spent my whole life chasing the success I thought I wanted — one that looked great on paper.\n\nBut when I finally got there, I realized the success wasn’t worth the sacrifices.\n\nIt wasn’t worth my happiness, my health, my time — things money can’t buy back. \n\nI chose to leave before I really even started because I wanted to start living NOW. Not in 1 year, 5 years, or maybe never.\n\nAnd I knew the longer I stayed, the easier it would be to convince myself to wait just a little longer.\n\nIt’s been a year since I left and it’s the best decision I’ve ever made. \n\nI’m excited to share more about what I learned during my career transition and what’s next ✨\n\n#lawyer #careerchange #techsales #lawtok #quitmyjob",
